    "For a self-hosted server, enter the full http:// or https:// address from its operator. If you host Meow on your computer, use its LAN address on the same Wi-Fi. 127.0.0.1 on your iPhone points to the iPhone itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用自建服务器时，请填写运营者提供的完整 http:// 或 https:// 地址。若部署在电脑上，请连接同一 Wi-Fi 并使用电脑的局域网地址。iPhone 上的 127.0.0.1 指向手机自身。"
