      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a terminal on your computer, run the command below. It checks the server, asks for your Device Key and connects Claude Code and Codex.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在电脑的终端里运行下面的命令。它会检查服务器、询问你的 Device Key，并连接 Claude Code 和 Codex。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
