    "Meow V1 does not send saved replies. You can copy this text and respond on your computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meow V1 不会发送已保存的回复。你可以复制这些内容，回到电脑作答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Meow V1 only delivers notifications. Continue in the agent on your computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meow V1 仅提供通知。请回到电脑上的 Agent 继续处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Meow notifies you when an agent finishes, fails or needs your attention. Continue on your computer when needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当 Agent 完成任务、执行失败或需要你关注时，Meow 会发送通知。需要处理时，请回到电脑继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Meow tells you when an agent finishes, fails or needs an answer, and you can reply right from the notification.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent 完成任务、出错或需要你回答时，Meow 会通知你，你可以直接在通知里回复。"
