    "On your computer, run the first command, paste your Device Key from the Copy Device Key button, and press Return. Then run the curl command. These examples work in bash and zsh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在电脑上运行第一条命令，粘贴通过“复制设备密钥”按钮获取的密钥并回车，再运行 curl 命令。以下示例适用于 bash 和 zsh。"
