      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未归类"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unmerge group": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解除合并"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unread": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未读"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unread attention or failure": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有未读的提醒或失败消息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unsent records": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未发送的记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use an https:// address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请使用 https:// 地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the address from the person running your Meow server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Meow 服务器维护者提供的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the hosted Meow server": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Meow 官方服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the official Meow server, or enter your own server address. You can change it later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Meow 官方服务器，也可以输入自建服务器地址。之后可在设置中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses your iPhone's default notification sound. Send a test notification to hear it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 iPhone 的系统默认提示音。发送测试通知即可试听。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify installation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View all pending questions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看全部待回答问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "待回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for a test notification from your computer…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待来自电脑的测试通知…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your answer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "待回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting to send": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待发送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the version appears, return to setup and run the connection command. Keep your Device Key ready to paste when asked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看到版本号后，返回配置页面运行连接命令，并在提示时粘贴 Device Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where do I get a server address?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如何获取服务器地址？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You answered": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have replies waiting to send. Keep waiting, or discard them to change servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有回复等待发送。你可以继续等待，或放弃这些回复后切换服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll register again on this server with a new Device Key. Update your agents to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将在此服务器重新注册并生成新的 Device Key，请更新 Agent 使用的密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll register on the new server with a new Device Key. Update your agents to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将在新服务器重新注册并获取新的 Device Key。请为 Agent 更新为新密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你目前处于离线状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've read everything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有通知都已读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agents are calling.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Agent 在呼叫你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your answer is saved and will be sent when the connection is back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的回答已保存，网络恢复后会自动发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your answer wasn't accepted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的回答没有被接受"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your computer connection is working. Finish a task in your agent to check automatic notifications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑已连接。请在 Agent 中完成一次任务，检查自动通知是否正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your computer connection is working. For automatic Codex notifications, authorize both Meow hooks in /hooks and confirm a real task result arrives here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑连接已验证。要接收 Codex 自动通知，请在 /hooks 中授权两个 Meow Hook，并确认这里能收到真实任务的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS / Linux · Direct install": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS / Linux · 直接安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS · Homebrew": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS · Homebrew"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "meow setup sends a CLI connection test. You can also run meow \"Hello\" in your terminal. This test does not verify agent hooks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "meow setup 会发送一条 CLI 连接测试通知。也可以在终端运行 meow \"Hello\"。这项测试不验证 Agent Hook。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刚刚"
          }
        }
      }
    }
